        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, outside air intake, stainless steel, DN 370</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, outside air intake, stainless steel, DN 370
Disposal of an outside mounted stainless steel tube with air inlet of 400 mm diameter. Weight per element 32 kg;
UUID: 724ecdfe-4d8e-42c1-aeb4-f0744f4d3602
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_724ecdfe-4d8e-42c1-aeb4-f0744f4d3602.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
